{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id179847385"}, "name":{"label":"Junesen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-02T07:45:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13466876991"}, "title":{"label":"I like the simplified controls on the iPad"}, "content":{"label":"I played it briefly on the PC and I was hesitant about getting it on iOS because of the simplified controls.  After playing with it for a few minutes I realized that the simplified controls are much better for me.  Yes, sometimes I accidentally gift people bait and set off bombs unintentionally on my farm.  But I think the tap interface is so much easier than the cumbersome keyboard controls.  On the PC I spent a couple of nights sleeping on the porch because I couldn’t figure out how to open the door!\n\nThe game itself is excellent.  It is so satisfying to go from astruggling farmer to become affluent in the game.  There are also many puzzles sprinkled into the game.  And there is the constant pursuit of the next improvement of your tools or your farm.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
