{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id132171758"}, "name":{"label":"Cmarie90"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-07T06:47:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13368070503"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed in mobile app"}, "content":{"label":"I absolutely love this game on my console, so when the opportunity came to play on mobile, I jumped on the band wagon. However, I am very disappointed in the layout and the game play. On console, my energy meter doesn’t deplete NEARLY as quickly compared to this one where just a few simple tasks has my meter in the red. Where I can get 50+ pieces of wood and only have my meter depleted by 1/4, the mobile game depletion is double that. Plus… WHY(!!!!) is the date/time/gold bars so BIG!! And I cannot fully see my energy meter either. So irritating. Not to mention, it causes my mobile device to heat up so much it’s almost impossible to touch (there is no case on the device) I’ll likely be deleting the app. Very disappointed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
