{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id171683678"}, "name":{"label":"That other guy, me!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-31T06:23:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13337877193"}, "title":{"label":"Good game, needs a couple small changes"}, "content":{"label":"Over all, bravo and well done. Fantastic\n\nA few issues with the game though, personally. \n\nDays are way too short. Insanely short. They either need to be longer, or they need to have an option of longer days in settings. \n\nLet us work through the entire night. Give a small extra debuff but seriously, this doesn’t make sense why you can’t. \n\nGive clothes a bonus of some type or slots to modify them. It’s kind of dumb that only boots and rings are armor. \n\nPut some randomness in the npcs", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
